 "summary": "A family of eight single Schottky barrier rectifiers in the flat-lead SOD-123FL surface-mount package, rated 1 A average forward current and 25 A single-cycle surge. The part number gives the reverse voltage rating, from 20 V (DSK12) to 200 V (DSK120). Uses listed for them are fast switching, circuit protection and voltage clamping. DSK120 is the 200 V part.",
